      "body": "Colleen 是一个轻量、类型安全的 Kotlin / Java Web 框架。\n\nGitHub：https://github.com/cymoo/colleen\n\n## 主要特点\n\n- 显式配置\n- 可组合的中间件\n- 自动参数提取\n- 清晰直接的依赖注入\n- 基于虚拟线程的同步请求处理模型\n\n## 设计理念\n\n- 显式优于隐式\n- 同步优于异步\n- 类型安全不可或缺\n- 清晰本身就是 feature\n- 魔法是负债\n\n## 安装\n\n```xml\n<dependency>\n    <groupId>io.github.cymoo</groupId>\n    <artifactId>colleen</artifactId>\n    <version>0.1.0</version>\n</dependency>\n```\n\n## Hello World\n\n```kotlin\nfun main() {\n    val app = Colleen()\n    app.get(\"/\") { \"hello world\" }\n    app.listen(8000)\n}\n```\n\n## 简明示例\n\n```kotlin\nimport io.github.cymoo.colleen.*\nimport io.github.cymoo.colleen.middleware.*\n\n// ---------- Function-style handlers ----------\n\nfun getUser(id: Path<Int>, service: UserService): User =\n    service.find(id.value)\n\nfun createUser(body: Json<CreateUser>, service: UserService): User =\n    service.create(body.value.name)\n\n// ---------- Controller-style Handlers ----------\n\n@Controller(\"/api\")\nclass ApiController {\n\n    @Get(\"/ping\")\n    fun ping(): String = \"pong\"\n\n    @Get(\"/users/{id}\")\n    fun get(id: Path<Int>, service: UserService): User =\n        service.find(id.value)\n}\n\n// ---------- Application ----------\n\nfun main() {\n    val app = Colleen()\n\n    // Provide service\n    app.provide(UserService())\n\n    // Register middleware\n    app.use(RequestLogger())\n    app.use(Cors())\n\n    // Lambda-style\n    app.get(\"/\") { \"Hello World\" }\n\n    // Function-style\n    app.get(\"/users/{id}\", ::getUser)\n    app.post(\"/users\", ::createUser)\n\n    // Controller-style\n    app.addController(ApiController())\n\n    app.listen(8000)\n    println(\"→ http://localhost:8000\")\n}\n\n// ---------- Data ----------\n\ndata class CreateUser(val name: String)\ndata class User(val id: Int, val name: String)\n\n// ---------- Service ----------\n\nclass UserService {\n\n    private val users = mutableMapOf(\n        1 to User(1, \"Alice\"),\n        2 to User(2, \"Bob\")\n    )\n\n    private var nextId = 3\n\n    fun create(name: String): User {\n        val user = User(nextId++, name)\n        users[user.id] = user\n        return user\n    }\n\n    fun find(id: Int): User =\n        users[id] ?: throw NotFound(\"User not found\")\n}\n```",
